	(text "Baseboard page: a USB2.0 hub merges the USB of the 3 SoCs into one host uplink; USB-C = host port (CC 5.1k pull-down = sink/UFP); 5V->3V3 LDO supply; power-indicator LED; SYNC open-drain with 4.7k pull-up (shared sync line across the 3 boards)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0e78ead5-ea7d-469f-88e7-0e5233ead367"))
